2026-07-27T11:28:14.7742573Z i /tmp/RtmpLOZjTF/duckdb
2026-07-27T11:28:14.7743073Z This is removed when the R session ends.
2026-07-27T11:28:14.7743692Z * Extensions are re-downloaded each session.
2026-07-27T11:28:14.7744257Z * Secrets are lost.
2026-07-27T11:28:14.7745062Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = TRUE) (or create ~/.duckdb) to keep them (suitable for most users).
2026-07-27T11:28:14.7746874Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = FALSE) to accept the temporary directory (and silence this message).
2026-07-27T11:28:14.7748725Z i See ?duckdb_storage for details and alternatives.
